        "basis": []
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "arm-risc-design",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "targets": [
        {
          "source_id": "web-computer-science-arm-instruction-sets",
          "evidence_id": "evidence-58dcc8093664"
        }
      ],
      "supporting_quotes": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-58dcc8093664",
          "exact": "The ARM architecture is a load–store architecture. Uniform 16 × 32-bit register file (including the program counter, stack pointer and the link register). Fixed instruction width of 32 bits to ease decoding and pipelining, at the cost of decreased code density. Later, the Thumb instruction set added 16-bit instructions and increased code density."
        }
      ],
      "applied_rule_refs": [
        "VAL-001"
      ],
      "rationale": "引文原文 [0, 50] \"The ARM architecture is a load–store architecture\" 直接支持 \"load-store 架构\"；[52, 111] \"Uniform 16 × 32-bit register file\" 支持 \"统一 16×32 位寄存器堆\"；[127, 180] \"Fixed instruction width of 32 bits to ease decoding and pipelining, at the cost of decreased code density\" 支持 \"固定 32 位指令宽度以简化译码与流水线（以代码密度为代价）\"；[210, 260] \"the Thumb instruction set added 16-bit instructions and increased code density\" 支持 \"Thumb 指令集补充 16 位指令提高代码密度\"。claim 各分句与引文逐段对应，无引申，判定为 supported。独立性：target 的 provenance 为空对象且引文无转载声明，无法举证独立性，basis 置空。",
      "rationale_offsets": [
        {
          "source_id": "web-computer-science-arm-instruction-sets",
          "evidence_id": "evidence-58dcc8093664",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 260
        }
      ],
      "independence": {
        "group_id": "web-computer-science-arm-instruction-sets",
        "basis": []
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "arm-thumb",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "targets": [
        {
          "source_id": "web-computer-science-arm-instruction-sets",
          "evidence_id": "evidence-e8d2d7132c1c"
        }
      ],
      "supporting_quotes": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-e8d2d7132c1c",
          "exact": "To improve compiled code density, processors since the ARM7TDMI (released in 1994) have featured the Thumb compressed instruction set, which have their own state. When in this state, the processor executes the Thumb instruction set, a compact 16-bit encoding for a subset of the ARM instruction set."
        }
      ],
      "applied_rule_refs": [
        "VAL-001"
      ],
      "rationale": "引文原文 [26, 133] \"processors since the ARM7TDMI (released in 1994) have featured the Thumb compressed instruction set, which have their own state\" 直接支持 \"自 ARM7TDMI（1994 年发布）起，处理器具备 Thumb 压缩指令集状态\"；[176, 243] \"a compact 16-bit encoding for a subset of the ARM instruction set\" 支持 \"ARM 指令集子集的紧凑 16 位编码\"。claim 与引文逐句对应，无超出引文的断言，判定为 supported。独立性：target 的 provenance 为空对象且引文无转载声明，无法举证独立性，basis 置空。",
